Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,It is five thirty in\Nthe morning and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.18,0:00:04.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,I have not moved for\Nthree hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:07.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,My mother is in the\Nchair by my window.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:08.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,My father is propped\Nagainst
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:10.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,the foot of my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:11.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,Both of them are\Nfacing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:14.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,Both of their mouths\Nare open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:16.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Neither of them has\Nblinked since
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:18.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,I woke up, and the\Nthing that arranged
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:20.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,them has not left this\Nroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:22.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,At twenty past two I\Nwoke up to a scream
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,on the other side of\Nthe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:26.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,It stopped in the\Nmiddle, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:28.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,a door had been shut\Non it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,I got as far as my\Ndoor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:31.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then I did the\Nstupidest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:33.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,thing I will ever do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:35.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,I went to the bathroom\Nfirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:36.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,Three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,I put the light on, I\Nwashed my hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:41.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I opened the door\Na crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:43.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,There was blood on the\Ncarpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.08,0:00:44.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,Not a drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:46.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,A smear, dragged from\Nmy parents' room
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:48.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,all the way to the top\Nof the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.95,0:00:50.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,The front door was\Ntwelve
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.28,0:00:51.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,steps down those\Nstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.87,0:00:53.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,I did not take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.51,0:00:55.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,I got into my bed and\Npulled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.23,0:00:57.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,the sheets over my\Nhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.15,0:00:59.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then my bedroom door\Ncreaked open, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.48,0:01:02.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,I pulled the blanket\Ndown off one eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:02.51,Word,,0,0,0,,IT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:02.78,Word,,0,0,0,,WAS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:03.04,Word,,0,0,0,,BENT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.05,0:01:03.30,Word,,0,0,0,,OVER
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:03.57,Word,,0,0,0,,IN
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:03.83,Word,,0,0,0,,MY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:04.09,Word,,0,0,0,,DOORWAY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.10,0:01:04.35,Word,,0,0,0,,AND
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:04.68,Word,,0,0,0,,IT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:04.98,Word,,0,0,0,,WAS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.99,0:01:05.29,Word,,0,0,0,,FAR
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:05.59,Word,,0,0,0,,TOO
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:05.89,Word,,0,0,0,,TALL
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:06.20,Word,,0,0,0,,FOR
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:06.50,Word,,0,0,0,,MY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:06.80,Word,,0,0,0,,ROOM.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:07.82,Word,,0,0,0,,HAIRLESS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:08.42,Word,,0,0,0,,NO
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.43,0:01:09.00,Word,,0,0,0,,EYES.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.03,0:01:09.59,Word,,0,0,0,,NO
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.16,Word,,0,0,0,,MOUTH.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.19,0:01:10.53,Word,,0,0,0,,NOTHING
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:10.87,Word,,0,0,0,,ON
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:11.21,Word,,0,0,0,,ITS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.22,0:01:11.56,Word,,0,0,0,,FACE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:11.90,Word,,0,0,0,,AT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.91,0:01:12.24,Word,,0,0,0,,ALL.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.27,0:01:12.67,Word,,0,0,0,,ARMS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:13.07,Word,,0,0,0,,HANGING
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:13.48,Word,,0,0,0,,PAST
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.49,0:01:13.88,Word,,0,0,0,,ITS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.89,0:01:14.29,Word,,0,0,0,,KNEES.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:14.74,Word,,0,0,0,,BACK
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.75,0:01:15.17,Word,,0,0,0,,SLOUCHED
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:15.61,Word,,0,0,0,,RIGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.62,0:01:16.04,Word,,0,0,0,,OVER.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:16.73,Word,,0,0,0,,WEARING
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.74,0:01:17.41,Word,,0,0,0,,NOTHING.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.44,0:01:20.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,And it was dragging my\Nmother and my father
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:22.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,in by the arms, one in\Neach hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:24.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,It propped my father\Nagainst
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.46,0:01:26.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,my bed, facing my\Npillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.41,0:01:27.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then it sat my mother\Nin the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.99,0:01:29.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,chair, turned the same\Nway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.97,0:01:31.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,It arranged them, like\Nsomething that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.98,0:01:34.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,wanted the picture to\Ncome out right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.43,0:01:36.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then it put both hands\Non my wall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:38.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,and painted a circle,\Nand a star
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.65,0:01:41.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,inside the circle,\Nupside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.11,0:01:43.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then it dragged one\Nline of letters
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:45.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,underneath it with one\Nfinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.03,0:01:46.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,It was too dark to\Nread.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:48.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,And then it folded\Nitself up on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.83,0:01:51.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,my floor and went\Nunder my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:53.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,Under my bed, with me\Non top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.54,0:01:55.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,That was three hours\Nago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:56.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,Lie still that long\Nand your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:58.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,eyes get better at the\Ndark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:00.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,So I move my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:01.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,Not my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.87,0:02:03.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Just my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:05.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,And I can read it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:07.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,It says: I know you're\Nawake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:08.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,It never had to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:11.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,It wrote that before I\Nopened my eyes, and it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:14.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,has waited three hours\Nfor me to read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.45,0:02:16.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,If you were in that\Nbed, would you have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.33,0:02:17.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,stayed still, or run\Nfor the door?
